# src/apps/daemon/internal/integrations/sub

## Purpose
Subscription ingestion owner: safe remote fetch, format detection/normalization, profile state, and daemon-owned refresh lifetime.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `integrations` (rank 3; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (51): `aggregate.go`, `aggregate_concurrency_test.go`, `aggregate_test.go`, `candyconnect_presets.go`, `clashconfig.go`, `client_configs_list.go`, `convert.go`, `convert_test.go`, `deeplink.go`, `deeplink_test.go`, `dohot_frp_presets.go`, `egress.go` …

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `sub`.
- Notable exported surface: `AggregateSubscriptions`, `BuildClashYAML`, `CandyConnectPreset`, `CandyConnectPresets`, `CandyConnectProtocol`, `ClashConfig`, `ClientConfigsList`, `ContentParser`, `ConversionIssue`, `ConversionReport` …
- Daemon-local dependencies: `internal/foundation/netpolicy`, `internal/foundation/redact`, `internal/foundation/resourcebudget`, `internal/foundation/textconfusables`, `internal/integrations/captchaclient`, `internal/networking/dns`, `internal/networking/geoip`, `internal/networking/proxyconfig`.
- Direct daemon callers: `cmd`, `internal/adapters/api`.

## Invariants
- Remote subscription fetch, parsing/normalization, profile state, and refresh lifetime have one owner.
- Per-node semantics use networking/proxyconfig rather than another parser representation.
- `integrations` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

## Navigation
- Read this file first, then direct child `.context` files before editing a deeper folder.
- Update this context when ownership, supported interfaces, or child-folder meaning changes; do not use it as a changelog.
